    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jones</strong> is a first person exploration game set in an endless void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players navigate through &quot;pills&quot; in order to explore the environment, while being coerced by an unknown voice that talks about your every little move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player navigates and interacts with an unfamiliar environment, simulating a struggle with addiction. The game progresses based upon the choices of the player, each decision altering the final outcome. Switching back and forth from &quot;the void&quot; and game's physical world, the player become unsure of what is real and right anymore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This experience lasts approximately 45-60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Different Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Differing Environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A linear story set in a endless void</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059200/extras/7a97f68cb4c099ac8fcc6d434389ec58.poster.avif?t=1754352396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059200/extras/7a97f68cb4c099ac8fcc6d434389ec58.webm?t=1754352396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059200/extras/7a97f68cb4c099ac8fcc6d434389ec58.mp4?t=1754352396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jones</strong> is a first person exploration game set in an endless void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players navigate through &quot;pills&quot; in order to explore the environment, while being coerced by an unknown voice that talks about your every little move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player navigates and interacts with an unfamiliar environment, simulating a struggle with addiction. The game progresses based upon the choices of the player, each decision altering the final outcome. Switching back and forth from &quot;the void&quot; and game's physical world, the player become unsure of what is real and right anymore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This experience lasts approximately 45-60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Different Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Differing Environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A linear story set in a endless void</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059200/extras/7a97f68cb4c099ac8fcc6d434389ec58.poster.avif?t=1754352396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059200/extras/7a97f68cb4c099ac8fcc6d434389ec58.webm?t=1754352396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059200/extras/7a97f68cb4c099ac8fcc6d434389ec58.mp4?t=1754352396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
